   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Verksamhetsst&#xf6;d till ISDP 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">1.Verksamhetsst&#xf6;d till Institutet f&#xf6;r S&#xe4;kerhets- och Utvecklingspolitik (Institute for Security and Development Policy) f&#xf6;r budget&#xe5;ret 2024. ISDP:s verksamhet syftar till &#xf6;kad dialog f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rebygga och l&#xf6;sa konflikter. Detta g&#xf6;rs genom policyrelevant analys, dialogm&#xf6;ten och konferenser.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2.	Operational support to the Institute for Security and Development Policy for 2024. ISDP&#x2019;s operations aim to increase dialogue in order to prevent and solve conflicts. This is carried out through policy-relevant analysis, dialogue meetings and conferences.</narrative>
  </description>
